================================================================================
Dataset attribution
================================================================================

MemGym dataset repositories on HuggingFace each carry their own LICENSE marker
in their dataset card README. The MemGym-released datasets are CC-BY-NC-4.0
unless noted otherwise. The MemGym-DR dataset is composed of research-paper-
derived synthetic queries (source_dataset = "deep_research") and does NOT
incorporate Wikipedia-derived content; therefore no CC-BY-SA-4.0 propagation
applies to the released DR data.

The MemGym-IR data-generation pipeline (src/memgym/pipelines/memgym_ir/)
produces derivatives of MuSiQue, 2WikiMultihopQA, and HotpotQA, which are
themselves Wikipedia-derived (CC-BY-SA-4.0). MemGym does not redistribute
any MemGym-IR-generated data; users who run that pipeline are responsible
for honoring the upstream Wikipedia CC-BY-SA-4.0 terms in their own
derivative artifacts.
